  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>直冲云霄——创造模组体验！</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ff08eee2-e472-47a4-a8e2-2aea7bf80230.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/6m5qwFqx3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1546699/description_d2601294-740c-418e-b4bf-82eaebe1d5fc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffwishies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1546699/description_3a23b6d1-831b-4325-8d52-fa5c2e963dee.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘</strong></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>一个精心挑选模组以完美搭配“创造（Create）”模组的整合包！</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘</strong></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>特色内容：</strong></span></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>⚙️ <span style=\"color:#fff\">创造（Create）+ 众多创造模组扩展！（创造航空、创造：终极工厂等更多！）</span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">⚙️ <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>全新装饰物！（杂物风格、积灰装饰、Macaw系列模组等更多！）</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">⚙️ <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>丰富的支线任务，让游戏充满乐趣！</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">⚙️ <span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>遍布全球的全新生物与动物！（Re:Animal、~Primal~、Alex's Mobs、Tide等更多！）</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘⫘</strong></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>信息：</strong></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>任务并非强制完成！</strong></span></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">完成任务仅有助于获取名为“创造代币（Creation Tokens）”的自定义代币，用于兑换非常实用的物品（例如：自然与探索指南针、传送石等）。</span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>想要获取创造代币，你必须100%完成一整条任务线！</strong></span></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">如果标注了（可选），这并不意味着你可以选择不完成它，而仅仅表示该部分对主线任务方向并不重要！！</span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>⫘⫘⫘</strong></span><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>⫘⫘⫘</strong></span><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>⫘⫘⫘</strong></span><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>⫘⫘⫘</strong></span><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>⫘⫘⫘</strong></span><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>⫘⫘⫘</strong></span><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>⫘⫘⫘</strong></span><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>⫘⫘⫘</strong></span><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>⫘⫘⫘</strong></span><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>⫘⫘⫘</strong></span><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>⫘⫘⫘</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>默认按键设置：</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Y - 队伍界面！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>V - 语音聊天！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>B - 背包！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>M - 地图！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=